<title>ISRAEL: Israel's October trade deficit $926 mln.</title>
<headline>Israel's October trade deficit $926 mln.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's trade deficit in October totalled $926 million, the Central Bureau of Statistics said on Monday.</p>
<p>	     Oct 96    Sept 96    Oct 95</p>
<p>Exports    1,729     1,632	1,360</p>
<p>Imports    2,654     2,316	2,391</p>
<p>Balance    - 926     - 684     -1,031</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in millions of dollars.</p>
<p>In the first 10 months of the year the deficit totalled $9.092 billion, up 8.6 percent from the same period last year.</p>
<p>In the past few months, the trend has been one of stable imports while exports have grown slightly, the statistics bureau said.</p>
</text>
